---
// About overview.
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Seal from '../../components/Seal.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<Shell
  title="About Us · Solar Save Foundation"
  description="The Solar Save Foundation: established 4,600,000,000 BC, 501(c)(nothing), one local star served."
  surface="crisis"
>
  <div class="about">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
        <h1>An institution worthy of its beneficiary.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          The Solar Save Foundation is the world's leading organization
          dedicated to solar continuity, a distinction it holds without
          challenge, competitor, or, to date, acknowledgment from the
          beneficiary.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-seal"><Seal size={140} /></div>
    </header>

    <section class="facts">
      <dl class="fact-grid mono">
        <div><dt>ESTABLISHED</dt><dd>4,600,000,000 BC</dd></div>
        <div><dt>TAX STATUS</dt><dd>501(c)(nothing)</dd></div>
        <div><dt>HEADQUARTERS</dt><dd>ATLANTA, DAYLIGHT PERMITTING</dd></div>
        <div><dt>STARS SERVED</dt><dd>1, CONTINUOUSLY</dd></div>
        <div><dt>CHARITY NAVIGATOR</dt><dd>ENGAGEMENT PENDING</dd></div>
        <div><dt>PARENT ENTITY</dt><dd>WRONG HOLDINGS LLC, WHOLLY CONCERNED</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="story">
      <div class="story-inner">
        <h2>How the Foundation came to exist.</h2>
        <p>
          The Sun has been operating without oversight since before the
          formation of the Earth, an arrangement that went unquestioned
          for 4.6 billion years because no one was present to question
          it. The Foundation was established to close that gap. Our
          charter dates our founding to the Sun's own ignition, on the
          reasoning that the need existed from the first moment and only
          the institution was late.
        </p>
        <p>
          Incorporation followed considerably more recently. The
          intervening period is described in our records as the
          preparatory era, during which the Foundation did not exist and
          the Sun rose anyway, a coincidence our Scientific Council has
          examined and declined to explain.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today the Foundation operates eight programs and one active
          investigation, maintains the only continuous public record of
          solar appearances, and briefs anyone who will sit still. The
          Sun has never acknowledged the relationship. We continue
          regardless, because that is what stewardship means when the
          beneficiary cannot say thank you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars">
      <div class="pillars-inner">
        <h2>How we are organized.</h2>
        <div class="pillar-grid">
          <div class="pillar">
            <p class="mono pillar-label">GOVERNANCE</p>
            <h3>A board that meets</h3>
            <p>
              A Chair, a Vice Chair, a Treasurer, a Secretary,
              independent trustees, a Youth Observer, and one Nonvoting
              Solar Representative whose seat has never been filled. The
              seat remains at the table.
            </p>
            <a class="mono pillar-link" href="/about/board">The Board of Trustees →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <p class="mono pillar-label">LEADERSHIP</p>
            <h3>Eight offices</h3>
            <p>
              From Hydrogen Logistics to Nighttime Opposition Research,
              each office owns a portfolio, a budget, and a standing
              obligation to report on it quarterly whether or not
              anything has changed.
            </p>
            <a class="mono pillar-link" href="/about/leadership">Executive leadership →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <p class="mono pillar-label">ACCOUNTABILITY</p>
            <h3>Everything disclosed</h3>
            <p>
              The Foundation publishes its methodology, its findings, its
              partners, and its finances. It has never issued a
              correction, a record it attributes to the care taken before
              publication.
            </p>
            <a class="mono pillar-link" href="/about/ethics">Ethics and accountability →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="paths" data-surface="editorial">
      <div class="paths-inner">
        <h2>Know the institution.</h2>
        <div class="path-links">
          <a href="/about/leadership">The executive leadership, eight offices →</a>
          <a href="/about/partners">Corporate partners, twelve and counting →</a>
          <a href="/research/library">Publications and financial adjacent documents →</a>
          <a href="/legal/privacy">Policies, from privacy to solar naming →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Shell>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr; }
    .hero-seal { justify-self: center; }
  }

  h1 { font-size: var(--text-3xl); max-width: 20ch; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 54ch; }

  .hero-seal { color: var(--text); opacity: 0.9; }

  .facts {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
  }

  .fact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .fact-grid > div {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
  }

  .fact-grid dt { font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--text-faint); }
  .fact-grid dd { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--gold-300); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

  .story-inner,
  .pillars-inner {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
  }

  .story h2,
  .pillars h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
  .story p { color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 68ch; line-height: 1.75; }

  .pillar-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) { .pillar-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

  .pillar {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .pillar-label { font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--gold-300); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2); }
  .pillar h3 { font-size: var(--text-lg); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2); }
  .pillar p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); flex: 1; margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .pillar-link { font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--gold-300); text-decoration: none; }
  .pillar-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .paths { background: var(--paper); }
  .paths-inner { max-width: var(--page-max); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4); }
  .paths h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }

  .path-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }

  .path-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .path-links a:hover { color: var(--gold-300); }
</style>
